      "text": "Weirdest Everyday Sights Around The World\n\n1. 🇮🇳 India - Cows in traffic\n2. 🇯🇵 Japan - Sleeping in public\n3. 🇺🇸 United States - Massive grocery stores\n4. 🇳🇱 Netherlands - Bikes everywhere\n5. 🇨🇳 China - Pajamas outside\n6. 🇮🇹 Italy - Loud conversations\n7. 🇦🇺 Australia - Giant house spiders\n8. 🇦🇪 UAE - Supercar police\n9. 🇨🇭 Switzerland - Bell-wearing cows\n10. 🇰🇷 South Korea - Matching couple outfits\n11. 🇧🇷 Brazil - Everyday beachwear\n12. 🇩🇪 Germany - Strict recycling rules\n13. 🇹🇭 Thailand - Tangled street wires\n14. 🇫🇷 France - Dogs in restaurants\n15. 🇲🇽 Mexico - Street food everywhere\n16. 🇳🇴 Norway - Babies sleep outside\n17. 🇵🇭 Philippines - Packed jeepneys\n18. 🇹🇷 Turkey - Tea everywhere\n19. 🇮🇸 Iceland - No mosquitoes\n20. 🇮🇩 Indonesia - Family on scooter\n\nSource: TheTravelTinker",
